  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SUPPORT TO THE COMMITTEE ON MISSING PERSONS&#x2019; (CMP) PROJECT ON EXHUMATION, IDENTIFICATION AND RETURN OF REMAINS OF MISSING PERSONS IN CYPRUS &#x2013; PHASE 16</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the Committee on Missing Persons (CMP) project. The expected output is to recover, identify and return to their families the remains of persons who went missing during the inter-communal fighting of 1963 to 1964 and the events of 1974.</narrative>
  </description>
